     "t": "raw",
     "html": "<h1>Work you can click and check</h1>",
     "class": "",
     "tag": "h1"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "For every example we say what we did, and what we didn't do. We don't invent clients, testimonials or numbers to fill the page."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "group",
   "class": "container",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "The dot next to each item shows where it stands, and it always has a word next to it: \"Finished and handed over\" for published work, \"Idea\" for a slot that's still empty."
    },
    {
     "t": "raw",
     "html": "<article class=\"work-item work-item-featured work-item-media\"> <div class=\"work-item-text\"> <span class=\"dot-tag\"><span class=\"dot-ring dot-d3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Finished and handed over</span> <h2><a href=\"https://ghazalalidoost.art\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ghazalalidoost.art</a></h2> <p class=\"work-label\">Client work · Ghazal Alidoust's portfolio website</p> <p class=\"work-label\">What we did: design and build</p> <a class=\"service-link\" href=\"https://ghazalalidoost.art\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Go and look at ghazalalidoost.art (opens a new tab)</a> </div> <figure class=\"work-item-shot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/img/ghazal-home-dark-en.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"/img/ghazal-home-dark-en.jpg\" alt=\"Ghazal Alidoust's website home page, dark mode, English\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"800\"></picture></figure> </article>",
     "class": "work-item work-item-featured",
     "tag": "article"
    },
    {
     "t": "raw",
     "html": "<article class=\"work-item work-placeholder\"> <span class=\"dot-tag\"><span class=\"dot-ring dot-d0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Idea</span> <h2>More to come</h2> <p class=\"work-label\">Nothing here yet, on purpose.</p> </article>",
     "class": "work-item work-placeholder",
     "tag": "article"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "Some work is private by nature, like penetration tests and internal documents. If we ever show it, it's with names and details removed, and only with the owner's written permission."
    }
